<item>
  <title>Analisis Survival: Kaplan-Meier untuk Pemula</title>
  <link>https://ibasgo.github.io/posts/kaplan-meier/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 




<p>Analisis survival mengukur waktu sampai suatu kejadian terjadi. Contohnya waktu sampai sembuh atau sampai kambuh.</p>
<section id="menjalankan-di-r" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="menjalankan-di-r">Menjalankan di R</h2>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb1" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode r code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode r"><span id="cb1-1"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">library</span>(survival)</span>
<span id="cb1-2">fit <span class="ot" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">survfit</span>(<span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">Surv</span>(waktu, status) <span class="sc" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">~</span> kelompok, <span class="at" style="color: #657422;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">data =</span> pasien)</span>
<span id="cb1-3"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">plot</span>(fit)</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Kurva Kaplan-Meier menunjukkan probabilitas bertahan pada tiap titik waktu. Perbedaan antarkelompok diuji dengan log-rank test.</p>


</section>

 ]]></description>
